                <head>No. 1010.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Magee to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-09-09"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 9,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Albert Erbers, <hi rendition="#italic">alias</hi> Eberson, is arrested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Magee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
